# The Mechanist, Aerial Artisan: "target artifact token you control becomes a 3/1 Construct artifact creature with flying." Turn 3 Pia's Thopter (a 1/1
# Thopter artifact creature token with flying, an artifact token already a creature) is the target: it is a 3/1 Construct afterwards - the Construct creature
# type replaces Thopter (the text does not say it is still a Thopter) and its base power and toughness are 3/1, set over the 1/1 - and still an artifact
# creature with flying, until the end of turn.

